1
00:01:47,300 --> 00:01:51,940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

2
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:54,980
[Episode 17]
[This story is purely fictional]

3
00:02:05,310 --> 00:02:07,290
Come, my friend.

4
00:02:07,870 --> 00:02:08,820
Have some water.

5
00:02:12,430 --> 00:02:15,890
You said you saw the Japanese

6
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:17,060
with the Zhainiangniang,

7
00:02:17,630 --> 00:02:18,850
and they could communicate with it?

8
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:27,610
The mountain deity is a monster.

9
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:30,130
It was tamed by the Japanese.

10
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:33,010
Tiezui.

11
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:38,010
Master Zhang.

12
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:42,780
Laogou's whistle?

13
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:44,690
The Japanese kidnapped him

14
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:46,820
to tame Zhainiangniang.

15
00:02:47,790 --> 00:02:49,840
The underground river cannot access the depths of the Xumi Realm.

16
00:02:50,750 --> 00:02:51,890
It's even riddled with miasma.

17
00:02:53,030 --> 00:02:55,690
The Japanese can only go there with the help of Zhainiangniang.

18
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:59,060
According to the murals,

19
00:02:59,630 --> 00:03:02,260
there are two ways to enter the Xumi Realm.

20
00:03:02,710 --> 00:03:03,260
One.

21
00:03:03,750 --> 00:03:05,340
Zhainiangniang can carry you inside.

22
00:03:07,430 --> 00:03:08,850
But it has now been killed by you.

23
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:10,730
And two.

24
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:12,690
Take the Lifeswapping Herb.

25
00:03:13,430 --> 00:03:14,570
But that's poisonous.

26
00:03:14,870 --> 00:03:16,850
You need the golden pot to cure the poison.

27
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:18,170
Here's the problem.

28
00:03:19,190 --> 00:03:21,500
We don't have the golden pot.

29
00:03:25,630 --> 00:03:27,060
Oh, Laogou.

30
00:03:27,470 --> 00:03:29,170
If you could tame Zhainiangniang,

31
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:30,570
why didn't you ask it

32
00:03:30,590 --> 00:03:32,410
to kill all the Japanese?

33
00:03:32,750 --> 00:03:33,290
Eighth Master.

34
00:03:33,630 --> 00:03:34,980
Zhainiangniang is not a dog.

35
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:36,340
It's not that docile.

36
00:03:36,910 --> 00:03:37,850
I bet

37
00:03:38,710 --> 00:03:40,100
Eighth Master is in grave danger as well.

38
00:03:40,590 --> 00:03:42,540
You don't know Laogou well enough.

39
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:45,010
He's as slippery as an eel.

40
00:03:45,430 --> 00:03:47,660
He'll keep himself safe.

41
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:52,130
Master Zhang.

42
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:54,730
What do we do next?

43
00:03:56,030 --> 00:03:57,850
Let's investigate the edges of the Xumi Realm

44
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:00,380
and find a way in.

45
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:04,540
My friend,

46
00:04:05,030 --> 00:04:05,890
let's continue.

47
00:04:07,590 --> 00:04:08,660
You mentioned

48
00:04:09,030 --> 00:04:11,730
Japanese soldiers who came back from the dead.

49
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:13,220
What did you mean by that?

50
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:01,370
The mountain deity punished us.

51
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:03,140
We were all killed.

52
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:04,900
You mean

53
00:05:05,310 --> 00:05:07,020
the Japanese went in the direction of the flare?

54
00:05:11,870 --> 00:05:14,340
That must be the hideout of Yoshiyuki Hatoyama and his unit.

55
00:05:17,490 --> 00:05:18,790
You said

56
00:05:18,950 --> 00:05:20,340
they came back from the dead,

57
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:22,100
and they killed all of you?

58
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:26,250
If they were this powerful,

59
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:29,930
they should come out and kill us now.

60
00:05:30,310 --> 00:05:31,220
Why are they hiding instead?

61
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:35,660
Could it be that Hatoyama is testing another spell?

62
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:45,700
The golden pot.

63
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:49,900
The golden pot you saw on the mural

64
00:05:51,070 --> 00:05:53,410
must be the pot Hatoyama used to place his spell.

65
00:05:55,270 --> 00:05:56,600
When I was interrogating Ding Qiansui,

66
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:57,580
he kept saying

67
00:05:58,240 --> 00:06:00,220
that Hatoyama had mastered everything

68
00:06:00,510 --> 00:06:01,460
in the Otherworld Tower.

69
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,540
The golden pot

70
00:06:05,270 --> 00:06:07,250
must contain the secret of the Otherworld Tower.

71
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:16,050
Fate is cruel.

72
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:18,250
If I had known this would happen,

73
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:19,410
I would have

74
00:06:20,310 --> 00:06:21,580
told you everything

75
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:23,020
about Wu Laogou.

76
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:25,250
Master Zhang.

77
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:33,340
Master Zhang, please bury us.

78
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:36,780
We have carried out the purpose of our lives.

79
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:39,100
You have achieved far more than what ordinary folk ever will.

80
00:06:39,510 --> 00:06:41,460
But we misplaced our belief,

81
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:43,050
and so, we ended up hurting people.

82
00:06:47,070 --> 00:06:48,140
To some, fire

83
00:06:49,750 --> 00:06:50,660
can bring light.

84
00:06:52,310 --> 00:06:53,370
But it can also burn.

85
00:06:59,630 --> 00:07:02,100
All of you are formidable warriors.

86
00:07:02,750 --> 00:07:04,100
Thank you.

87
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:06,170
All of you are heroes as well.

88
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:12,850
What else can I do for you?

89
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:19,220
I want to listen to the story of Wu Laogou.

90
00:07:21,070 --> 00:07:24,170
Then, I'll tell Ma Jinbao his story in the afterlife.

91
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:33,900
Back then, there was a famine in Changsha. People were displaced.

92
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:36,810
They banded together to steal food.

93
00:07:38,430 --> 00:07:40,490
Fifth Master was among them.

94
00:07:57,160 --> 00:07:57,700
Mister.

95
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:05,340
Brother, I know him.

96
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:06,660
He's a hooligan in the city

97
00:08:06,830 --> 00:08:08,140
who takes advantage of people like us.

98
00:08:08,480 --> 00:08:10,340
Sir, spare me some food, please.

99
00:08:10,430 --> 00:08:12,020
Miscreant! How dare you steal our belongings?

100
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:13,020
Kill him.

101
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:18,410
Brother.

102
00:08:19,310 --> 00:08:21,050
Stop. He'll die.

103
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:21,850
Move aside.

104
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:57,340
Let's go.

105
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:27,060
Little boy.

106
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:32,100
Who abandoned you here?

107
00:09:34,910 --> 00:09:35,890
I'll raise you from now on.

108
00:09:36,510 --> 00:09:38,820
You shall be Xiaozhu.

109
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:41,060
The name sounds tough.

110
00:09:41,670 --> 00:09:42,650
I hope you'll be

111
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:44,530
a tough guy like me.

112
00:09:47,840 --> 00:09:48,340
Who's there?

113
00:09:52,150 --> 00:09:52,890
What are you doing here?

114
00:09:53,670 --> 00:09:54,730
You want more beating?

115
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:00,420
You can have this.

116
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:03,730
I don't like to be indebted to anyone.

117
00:10:06,270 --> 00:10:07,370
If you don't save yourself,

118
00:10:07,910 --> 00:10:08,850
no one else will save you.

119
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:11,610
The immortals from high above do not notice common folks like us.

120
00:10:14,440 --> 00:10:14,850
Eat it.

121
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:21,850
Work for me from now on.

122
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:24,370
Have you watched The Heavenly Peace Celebration?

123
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:26,180
I will establish

124
00:10:26,910 --> 00:10:28,580
our very own safe haven in Changsha.

125
00:10:30,120 --> 00:10:30,820
So?

126
00:10:31,390 --> 00:10:32,530
Do you like your new outfit?

127
00:10:34,510 --> 00:10:35,340
Listen.

128
00:10:35,910 --> 00:10:38,010
From now on, you're my buddy.

129
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:41,300
We just need a fortress now.

130
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:42,940
Should we

131
00:10:43,550 --> 00:10:44,770
open a dog farm?

132
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:47,820
We dug out money to buy new clothes.

133
00:10:48,510 --> 00:10:49,850
If you can get us a plot of land,

134
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:51,220
I'll follow you

135
00:10:51,670 --> 00:10:52,340
and be loyal to you.

136
00:10:53,750 --> 00:10:54,370
Let me show you.

137
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:58,420
I taught you how to sit down just now.

138
00:10:58,630 --> 00:10:59,820
Did you forget already?

139
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:00,730
Again.

140
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:02,460
Sit.

141
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:04,650
Good boy.

142
00:11:04,910 --> 00:11:05,440
- You're back. - I'm hungry.

143
00:11:05,750 --> 00:11:06,180
I'm back.

144
00:11:06,200 --> 00:11:07,010
- Go and eat. - Okay.

145
00:11:10,200 --> 00:11:10,580
Laogou.

146
00:11:11,720 --> 00:11:12,370
Your food is here.

147
00:11:20,440 --> 00:11:21,580
We bought this dog farm

148
00:11:22,240 --> 00:11:23,530
a long time ago.

149
00:11:24,870 --> 00:11:26,460
How come we still don't have any customers?

150
00:11:28,480 --> 00:11:29,490
Running a business sure is tough.

151
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:31,250
Perhaps

152
00:11:32,080 --> 00:11:33,420
no one knows

153
00:11:33,440 --> 00:11:34,530
what we're selling?

154
00:11:35,630 --> 00:11:36,820
Are you blind?

155
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:38,610
Isn't it obvious?

156
00:11:39,550 --> 00:11:40,650
We sell guard dogs.

157
00:11:41,150 --> 00:11:42,770
You picked these dogs up from the street.

158
00:11:43,800 --> 00:11:44,930
They have not been trained.

159
00:11:47,760 --> 00:11:48,340
Right.

160
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:52,300
Xiaozhu. Eat now.

161
00:11:52,960 --> 00:11:54,570
Once you're full, I need you to do a somersault.

162
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:55,940
Do it 10,000 times per day.

163
00:11:56,880 --> 00:11:57,700
10,000 times.

164
00:11:57,750 --> 00:11:58,620
Don't laugh.

165
00:11:59,600 --> 00:12:00,690
You will learn how to throw a punch.

166
00:12:01,150 --> 00:12:02,170
Do it 10,000 times per day.

167
00:12:02,710 --> 00:12:03,650
10,000 times?

168
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:06,300
You're supposed to tame the dogs, not me.

169
00:12:07,440 --> 00:12:08,420
Will 1,000 times do?

170
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:10,730
You need to be strong.

171
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:12,890
Like me.

172
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:15,650
That way, no one will bully us.

173
00:12:15,870 --> 00:12:16,580
Listen.

174
00:12:18,120 --> 00:12:19,250
I have foreseen

175
00:12:19,910 --> 00:12:21,340
that our dog farm will be a huge deal.

176
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:23,340
It will be successful soon.

177
00:12:23,750 --> 00:12:26,130
When we have more dogs and customers,

178
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:28,730
our buns will have meat in them.

179
00:12:28,790 --> 00:12:30,460
As much meat as you want.

180
00:12:31,720 --> 00:12:33,700
Okay. I believe whatever you say.

181
00:12:33,700 --> 00:12:36,300
[Tongxing Boutique]

182
00:12:36,750 --> 00:12:38,220
Come back again.

183
00:12:41,670 --> 00:12:42,700
Careful, mister.

184
00:12:51,510 --> 00:12:53,130
You are what you wear.

185
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:54,730
Getting an expensive outfit sure changes everything.

186
00:12:59,270 --> 00:13:00,180
Hi, sir.

187
00:13:02,030 --> 00:13:02,640
Sir.

188
00:13:02,900 --> 00:13:03,530
Sir.

189
00:13:03,530 --> 00:13:04,100
Sir.

190
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:06,440
Sir, help us.

191
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:07,700
Spare us some food.

192
00:13:08,120 --> 00:13:10,610
- My child hasn't eaten for three days. - Go away.

193
00:13:11,250 --> 00:13:13,360
Please spare us some food.

194
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:16,010
Please.

195
00:13:16,270 --> 00:13:17,490
The world is unfair.

196
00:13:17,670 --> 00:13:18,890
The government doesn't care about us.

197
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:21,060
- The gods don't care about us either. - Sir.

198
00:13:21,120 --> 00:13:22,420
Sir, please help us.

199
00:13:22,480 --> 00:13:23,130
Please.

200
00:13:23,150 --> 00:13:24,700
Sir, spare us some food.

201
00:13:24,840 --> 00:13:26,650
Please, sir.

202
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:28,980
Please. Some food, please.

203
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:29,490
Sir.

204
00:13:29,490 --> 00:13:30,550
Sir.

205
00:13:30,550 --> 00:13:31,340
Make some noodles for them.

206
00:13:32,200 --> 00:13:32,980
I'll pay for it.

207
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:35,420
Thank you, sir.

208
00:13:35,750 --> 00:13:36,790
Thank you.

209
00:13:36,830 --> 00:13:38,550
- Thank you, sir. - Come with me after you eat.

210
00:13:39,120 --> 00:13:39,940
I'll find you a home.

211
00:13:40,360 --> 00:13:41,610
Thank you, sir.

212
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:43,250
Thank you, sir.

213
00:13:44,270 --> 00:13:45,060
Thank you, sir.

214
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:46,420
Useless Mystic Nine.

215
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:48,340
Useless gods.

216
00:13:49,670 --> 00:13:50,580
I'll save

217
00:13:52,030 --> 00:13:52,980
those you don't save.

218
00:13:58,340 --> 00:13:59,320
[Former Fifth Master of the Mystic Nine]

219
00:13:59,320 --> 00:14:00,180
Hurry up.

220
00:14:00,480 --> 00:14:01,460
Trying to escape?

221
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:02,180
Why are you hiding here?

222
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:03,300
Escape again, I dare you.

223
00:14:03,480 --> 00:14:04,580
No. No.

224
00:14:05,440 --> 00:14:06,490
- Never escape again. - Work harder!

225
00:14:06,550 --> 00:14:07,250
Escape again, I dare you.

226
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:07,980
Hurry up.

227
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:09,250
I'll whip you to death.

228
00:14:09,870 --> 00:14:10,530
Never escape again.

229
00:14:33,630 --> 00:14:34,010
Run!

230
00:14:55,910 --> 00:14:57,340
You stupid dog breeders.

231
00:14:57,670 --> 00:14:58,890
Do you even know who I am?

232
00:14:58,960 --> 00:15:00,580
Fifth Master of the Mystic Nine.

233
00:15:00,910 --> 00:15:02,700
Release them and hand over their indentures.

234
00:15:03,480 --> 00:15:04,730
Then, I'll spare your life.

235
00:15:05,670 --> 00:15:07,180
Who do you think you are?

236
00:15:07,510 --> 00:15:09,100
Trying to cross the Mystic Nine?

237
00:15:09,270 --> 00:15:11,250
The Mystic Nine has been abusing their power.

238
00:15:11,870 --> 00:15:13,700
Is Master Zhang not going to do something about it?

239
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:14,490
Master,

240
00:15:14,750 --> 00:15:16,220
their leader stays in their lofty palace.

241
00:15:16,440 --> 00:15:18,060
I heard the Mystic Nine has thousands of members.

242
00:15:18,480 --> 00:15:20,610
Zhang Qishan probably doesn't know about a trivial matter like this.

243
00:15:20,870 --> 00:15:23,370
Let's teach this guy a lesson on his behalf.

244
00:15:23,910 --> 00:15:24,850
Touch me if you dare.

245
00:15:25,120 --> 00:15:25,650
Master.

246
00:15:26,480 --> 00:15:28,460
The Mystic Nine also has a rule.

247
00:15:28,960 --> 00:15:30,700
Whoever defeats the leader of a clan

248
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:32,580
gets to take over his position in the Mystic Nine.

249
00:15:32,720 --> 00:15:35,530
You think you can take over my position?

250
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:36,850
Killing you

251
00:15:37,600 --> 00:15:39,610
will do justice to everyone else

252
00:15:40,030 --> 00:15:41,530
and earn me a solid reputation.

253
00:15:42,390 --> 00:15:43,530
What's the saying again?

254
00:15:43,750 --> 00:15:44,420
One chicken, two drumsticks?

255
00:15:44,910 --> 00:15:45,850
Two stones, one bird.

256
00:15:47,320 --> 00:15:48,700
You have a death wish!

257
00:15:52,060 --> 00:15:52,620
[Fifth]

258
00:15:54,380 --> 00:15:55,260
[Fifth]

259
00:15:58,500 --> 00:15:59,020
[Fifth]

260
00:15:59,100 --> 00:15:59,840
[Changsha Mystic Nine, Token]

261
00:15:59,840 --> 00:16:00,370
Master.

262
00:16:01,150 --> 00:16:02,820
You are now the Fifth Master of the Mystic Nine.

263
00:16:04,200 --> 00:16:04,890
Congratulations, Master.

264
00:16:05,080 --> 00:16:05,850
Well done, Master.

265
00:16:06,320 --> 00:16:07,940
- Fifth Master! - Thank you for saving us.

266
00:16:08,030 --> 00:16:10,250
Thank you, Fifth Master.

267
00:16:10,320 --> 00:16:12,940
Thank you for saving us, Fifth Master.

268
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:13,980
Thank you, Fifth Master.

269
00:16:13,980 --> 00:16:17,060
[Shared Legacy of the Mystic Nine]

270
00:16:53,600 --> 00:16:54,890
I am Wu Laogou.

271
00:16:55,600 --> 00:16:57,220
Owner of a dog farm.

272
00:16:58,030 --> 00:17:01,700
[Fifth]
I am now the Fifth Master.

273
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:08,660
We have a new Fifth Master.

274
00:17:09,680 --> 00:17:11,860
Great. Master Zhang isn't here yet.

275
00:17:12,510 --> 00:17:14,730
So you can enjoy your seat for a while.

276
00:17:49,580 --> 00:17:50,810
Ever since,

277
00:17:51,030 --> 00:17:52,980
Wu Laogou ceased being Wu Laogou,

278
00:17:54,200 --> 00:17:56,330
and has become the Fifth Master of the Mystic Nine.

279
00:17:57,920 --> 00:17:59,250
His wish of seeing Master Zhang

280
00:18:00,480 --> 00:18:01,770
also came true.

281
00:18:44,070 --> 00:18:44,460
Master Zhang.

282
00:18:45,350 --> 00:18:45,810
Look.

283
00:18:46,830 --> 00:18:48,250
The baby sleeps so soundly

284
00:18:48,310 --> 00:18:49,490
in this god-forsaken place.

285
00:18:50,160 --> 00:18:51,530
Isn't that odd?

286
00:18:53,350 --> 00:18:54,180
It feels like

287
00:18:54,790 --> 00:18:56,730
this baby has been actively guiding us on this trip.

288
00:18:57,070 --> 00:18:58,620
It's almost as if someone is controlling the baby.

289
00:18:59,070 --> 00:18:59,700
What do you think?

290
00:19:01,110 --> 00:19:02,660
Don't be mad if I tell you my opinion.

291
00:19:02,880 --> 00:19:03,330
Just say it.

292
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:06,330
This baby can sense the monster.

293
00:19:07,310 --> 00:19:08,980
It can also make expressions that only an adult can make.

294
00:19:09,440 --> 00:19:12,180
Perhaps he's not a baby at all?

295
00:19:12,550 --> 00:19:13,140
What do you mean?

296
00:19:17,030 --> 00:19:18,530
He's an adult.

297
00:19:20,350 --> 00:19:20,900
Impossible.

298
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:22,620
Perhaps

299
00:19:22,640 --> 00:19:24,330
this baby has a special power.

300
00:19:24,680 --> 00:19:27,010
For instance, he can sense invisible monsters,

301
00:19:27,350 --> 00:19:28,220
and we can't.

302
00:19:28,480 --> 00:19:29,050
Master Zhang...

303
00:19:29,240 --> 00:19:31,330
You know I don't believe in magic.

304
00:19:31,590 --> 00:19:32,330
Don't be superstitious.

305
00:20:03,940 --> 00:20:05,340
[Shushen Hall]

306
00:20:09,510 --> 00:20:10,140
Xiaozhu?

307
00:20:11,070 --> 00:20:11,810
What are you doing here?

308
00:20:37,310 --> 00:20:38,090
Laogou?

309
00:20:50,640 --> 00:20:51,250
Girls!

310
00:20:52,460 --> 00:20:52,980
Miss Huo?

311
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:54,770
Gather everyone. We're going to Xiangxi to save someone.

312
00:20:55,030 --> 00:20:55,700
Save someone?

313
00:20:56,920 --> 00:20:58,140
Where in Xiangxi is he?

314
00:20:58,960 --> 00:20:59,730
I'm not sure yet.

315
00:21:00,270 --> 00:21:01,490
Probably somewhere with a river.

316
00:21:01,960 --> 00:21:03,380
But there are many rivers in Xiangxi.

317
00:21:04,110 --> 00:21:04,940
We'll find out when we're there.

318
00:21:05,790 --> 00:21:06,810
But our clan barely settled down.

319
00:21:07,350 --> 00:21:08,330
There are many things to manage,

320
00:21:08,550 --> 00:21:09,660
and we lack manpower.

321
00:21:11,350 --> 00:21:13,010
Perhaps I'll ask for help from the Mystic Nine?

322
00:21:13,400 --> 00:21:14,860
Not many people trust me.

323
00:21:16,030 --> 00:21:16,940
I'll be found out

324
00:21:17,680 --> 00:21:18,900
regardless of who I send as my messenger.

325
00:21:20,510 --> 00:21:21,770
If the Japanese find out,

326
00:21:23,110 --> 00:21:24,220
things can be dire.

327
00:21:25,720 --> 00:21:27,460
What should we do, then?

328
00:21:29,640 --> 00:21:30,860
There's someone else I trust

329
00:21:31,030 --> 00:21:32,330
in the Mystic Nine.

330
00:21:32,960 --> 00:21:33,620
It seems like

331
00:21:35,680 --> 00:21:36,980
I have to visit Lunar Hotel

332
00:21:38,310 --> 00:21:39,380
in Beiping.

333
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:43,050
Tiezui.

334
00:21:44,680 --> 00:21:45,380
What's on your mind?

335
00:21:47,590 --> 00:21:48,980
I'm worried about Stinky Yu.

336
00:21:50,030 --> 00:21:51,220
He's seriously injured.

337
00:21:51,750 --> 00:21:52,940
When is he going to make a full recovery?

338
00:21:53,350 --> 00:21:53,860
Besides,

339
00:21:54,440 --> 00:21:56,140
there are many wild animals in the mountains.

340
00:21:56,750 --> 00:21:58,220
Xiaojin is taking care of him alone.

341
00:21:59,070 --> 00:22:00,140
Will they be in danger?

342
00:22:00,920 --> 00:22:02,010
He's from my clan.

343
00:22:02,720 --> 00:22:03,940
Our blood is different.

344
00:22:04,270 --> 00:22:05,290
Wounds will heal faster.

345
00:22:05,720 --> 00:22:06,330
Don't worry about him.

346
00:22:08,590 --> 00:22:10,140
Oh. How could I forget about that?

347
00:22:10,590 --> 00:22:11,290
You're right.

348
00:22:13,680 --> 00:22:15,380
This isn't what you wanted to tell me, is it?

349
00:22:15,920 --> 00:22:17,770
You know me so well, Master Zhang.

350
00:22:19,160 --> 00:22:19,940
You see,

351
00:22:20,920 --> 00:22:24,140
what do you think would happen

352
00:22:25,070 --> 00:22:28,380
if Hatoyama took the risk to come back up here

353
00:22:28,680 --> 00:22:30,010
from the Otherworld Tower?

354
00:22:31,030 --> 00:22:32,420
Even with Ding Qiansui protecting him,

355
00:22:33,590 --> 00:22:34,980
will he be able to leave Changsha City?

356
00:22:36,400 --> 00:22:38,140
He won't be able to leave the city.

357
00:22:38,960 --> 00:22:40,250
When the Mystic Nine caught the spies,

358
00:22:41,070 --> 00:22:43,290
we sealed all the secret passages leading to the outside of the city.

359
00:22:43,480 --> 00:22:46,180
So, he can only take the underground river. Right?

360
00:22:50,030 --> 00:22:50,530
Carry on.

361
00:22:51,590 --> 00:22:53,010
Master Zhang, perhaps

362
00:22:53,750 --> 00:22:55,090
Hatoyama took the underground river

363
00:22:55,350 --> 00:22:56,620
to avoid the mountain deity,

364
00:22:56,920 --> 00:22:57,810
also known as Zhainiangniang.

365
00:22:58,550 --> 00:22:59,700
If they came up to the ground,

366
00:23:00,160 --> 00:23:01,700
they wouldn't be able to go past Mount Heimen.

367
00:23:01,790 --> 00:23:02,380
Avoid?

368
00:23:03,200 --> 00:23:04,490
Do you think the Japanese would do that?

369
00:23:05,270 --> 00:23:06,420
They strap grenades

370
00:23:06,480 --> 00:23:07,940
on someone and toss him

371
00:23:08,590 --> 00:23:09,860
to the mountain deity.

372
00:23:11,640 --> 00:23:12,180
Right.

373
00:23:14,590 --> 00:23:15,770
I believe they didn't come up to the ground

374
00:23:16,880 --> 00:23:18,140
not because it would be a difficult journey,

375
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:21,180
but because they have no idea

376
00:23:21,200 --> 00:23:22,180
where they are heading.

377
00:23:23,440 --> 00:23:25,380
Only by following the underground river

378
00:23:25,830 --> 00:23:27,770
can they find the precise location.

379
00:23:29,510 --> 00:23:31,530
That makes sense, Master Zhang.

380
00:23:47,350 --> 00:23:47,810
Master Zhang.

381
00:23:48,550 --> 00:23:50,530
Hatoyama should be inside the mountain.

382
00:23:51,160 --> 00:23:52,620
Many unknown mountains

383
00:23:53,350 --> 00:23:55,050
lie behind Mount Heimen.

384
00:23:57,160 --> 00:23:58,010
So many mountains.

385
00:23:58,550 --> 00:23:59,330
Where should we start?

386
00:24:00,510 --> 00:24:01,490
We look for smoke during the day

387
00:24:02,000 --> 00:24:03,010
and wind during the night.

388
00:24:06,580 --> 00:24:10,680
[Several Days Later]

389
00:24:10,680 --> 00:24:11,090
Master.

390
00:24:12,070 --> 00:24:13,730
No traces of the Japanese here.

391
00:24:14,110 --> 00:24:15,620
And no entry found either.

392
00:24:16,480 --> 00:24:18,140
Master, I found nothing there either.

393
00:24:19,550 --> 00:24:20,620
This miasma forest

394
00:24:20,920 --> 00:24:22,010
is bigger than we expected.

395
00:24:22,590 --> 00:24:24,570
We're just scratching the surface.

396
00:24:24,960 --> 00:24:25,660
Should we continue?

397
00:24:26,070 --> 00:24:26,810
Continue.

398
00:24:27,270 --> 00:24:27,730
Yes.

399
00:24:38,350 --> 00:24:39,570
If Hatoyama has been here,

400
00:24:40,350 --> 00:24:41,420
he'll surely leave something behind.

401
00:24:44,260 --> 00:24:47,100
[Beiping]

402
00:24:47,180 --> 00:24:48,980
[Station Entrance]

403
00:24:56,660 --> 00:24:58,940
[Lunar Hotel]

404
00:25:01,190 --> 00:25:01,620
Thanks.

405
00:25:03,180 --> 00:25:06,420
[Lunar Hotel]

406
00:25:13,110 --> 00:25:14,010
A rare guest.

407
00:25:20,240 --> 00:25:20,940
Ms. Yin.

408
00:25:22,310 --> 00:25:24,570
Miss Huo, you came all the way to Beiping.

409
00:25:25,160 --> 00:25:27,010
Did something bad happen in Changsha?

410
00:25:29,480 --> 00:25:30,220
The Mystic Nine

411
00:25:30,240 --> 00:25:31,770
has undergone some changes

412
00:25:32,350 --> 00:25:33,330
due to Unit 401.

413
00:25:33,880 --> 00:25:35,530
I'm sure you're already aware of it.

414
00:25:36,540 --> 00:25:37,930
My husband did tell me about it.

415
00:25:39,200 --> 00:25:41,290
Laogou was kidnapped by the Japanese,

416
00:25:41,550 --> 00:25:42,730
and they went to Xiangxi to pursue him.

417
00:25:44,110 --> 00:25:44,810
I

418
00:25:44,830 --> 00:25:46,250
obtained important information in Changsha.

419
00:25:46,830 --> 00:25:47,460
However,

420
00:25:48,270 --> 00:25:49,700
I do not have the means to deliver it to Master Zhang.

421
00:25:50,750 --> 00:25:52,940
I came seeking your help.

422
00:25:53,350 --> 00:25:55,010
I wonder if you can reach Master Zhang

423
00:25:55,110 --> 00:25:56,490
and tell him to return to Changsha at once.

424
00:25:57,240 --> 00:25:58,660
What makes you think I can contact him?

425
00:25:59,400 --> 00:26:00,700
You're important to him.

426
00:26:01,070 --> 00:26:02,050
No matter where he is,

427
00:26:02,350 --> 00:26:04,290
he'll find a way to contact you.

428
00:26:05,110 --> 00:26:05,700
Besides,

429
00:26:06,480 --> 00:26:08,530
Master Zhang can ignore everyone's message,

430
00:26:09,200 --> 00:26:10,660
but never yours.

431
00:26:11,200 --> 00:26:11,900
Miss Huo,

432
00:26:12,550 --> 00:26:13,730
can I ask you something?

433
00:26:17,830 --> 00:26:19,530
What is

434
00:26:20,000 --> 00:26:21,220
Wu Laogou to you?

435
00:26:27,640 --> 00:26:28,420
We're lovers.

436
00:26:32,550 --> 00:26:34,770
I didn't expect honesty from you.

437
00:26:35,550 --> 00:26:36,770
I need a favor from you.

438
00:26:37,440 --> 00:26:39,460
Naturally, I have to be open and honest.

439
00:26:40,440 --> 00:26:42,250
You claimed to be open and honest.

440
00:26:42,960 --> 00:26:44,770
But here you are, asking me to tell my husband

441
00:26:44,830 --> 00:26:47,180
to give up on Wu Laogou and return to Changsha.

442
00:26:47,830 --> 00:26:49,460
You must have news of Laogou.

443
00:26:50,590 --> 00:26:51,810
Why can't you tell him right away?

444
00:26:52,680 --> 00:26:54,810
Because I have my reason, which I can't tell anyone.

445
00:26:56,680 --> 00:26:58,730
But if I can come here to seek your help,

446
00:26:59,200 --> 00:27:00,940
it means I have a plan.

447
00:27:01,920 --> 00:27:03,220
I will not put you

448
00:27:03,270 --> 00:27:04,380
or Master Zhang in danger.

449
00:27:05,680 --> 00:27:06,810
Here's the catch.

450
00:27:07,510 --> 00:27:09,140
I will only help you find my husband.

451
00:27:11,240 --> 00:27:11,900
Thank you.

452
00:27:27,340 --> 00:27:29,580
[Trove of all Treasures]

453
00:27:45,070 --> 00:27:46,530
I have found a way to escape.

454
00:27:47,240 --> 00:27:49,220
It is ingenious and dangerous at the same time.

455
00:27:50,440 --> 00:27:51,420
If you're reading this,

456
00:27:51,960 --> 00:27:53,140
please follow my instructions

457
00:27:53,480 --> 00:27:54,380
correctly.

458
00:27:55,270 --> 00:27:56,570
Otherwise, I'll die.

459
00:27:57,920 --> 00:27:59,050
It's okay if you don't want to take the risk.

460
00:28:00,240 --> 00:28:01,050
Walk your own path.

461
00:28:16,400 --> 00:28:16,930
Miss Huo.

462
00:28:20,720 --> 00:28:21,700
Are you lost?

463
00:28:23,310 --> 00:28:24,290
I am a friend of your master,

464
00:28:24,350 --> 00:28:25,380
Yin Xinyue.

465
00:28:25,720 --> 00:28:26,900
I just had a meal with her.

466
00:28:27,030 --> 00:28:28,380
I thought I could walk around a bit

467
00:28:28,550 --> 00:28:29,810
to sober up.

468
00:28:30,350 --> 00:28:31,770
You see, Miss Huo,

469
00:28:32,160 --> 00:28:33,940
this is the internal hall of Lunar Hotel.

470
00:28:34,270 --> 00:28:35,490
Many things here are confidential.

471
00:28:35,720 --> 00:28:36,700
No one can enter.

472
00:28:37,160 --> 00:28:37,940
Let me send you off.

473
00:28:38,920 --> 00:28:40,890
I heard the chief auctioneer of the internal hall

474
00:28:40,920 --> 00:28:42,770
oversees every auction in Lunar Hotel.

475
00:28:43,200 --> 00:28:44,380
He's good with math

476
00:28:44,680 --> 00:28:46,250
and possesses sharp business acumen.

477
00:28:47,160 --> 00:28:49,010
Can you bring me to him?

478
00:28:52,550 --> 00:28:54,490
I would like to pitch a sale to your chief auctioneer.

479
00:28:55,190 --> 00:28:56,760
A reliable source of mine

480
00:28:57,510 --> 00:28:59,640
told me that highly valuable ascended mummies

481
00:28:59,640 --> 00:29:01,290
will soon appear in Xiangxi.

482
00:29:01,790 --> 00:29:04,180
However, the mummies are located in a hidden, complex area.

483
00:29:04,590 --> 00:29:06,640
One can only find them if a huge investor like Lunar Hotel

484
00:29:06,640 --> 00:29:08,810
puts in the money and manpower.

485
00:29:09,160 --> 00:29:12,090
The mummies are of high quality.

486
00:29:12,640 --> 00:29:13,700
If you find them,

487
00:29:14,160 --> 00:29:15,290
you'll earn a fortune.

488
00:29:16,680 --> 00:29:18,140
I wonder if you've heard the rumor

489
00:29:18,200 --> 00:29:20,420
that the Huo Clan is laden with debts.

490
00:29:21,110 --> 00:29:22,050
The rumor is true.

491
00:29:22,680 --> 00:29:23,700
I came here today

492
00:29:24,160 --> 00:29:26,010
to save my clan.

493
00:29:27,350 --> 00:29:29,460
[10,000 yuan, Check]
These two checks prove my sincerity.

494
00:29:29,750 --> 00:29:31,620
You can keep it as collateral.

495
00:29:32,160 --> 00:29:33,660
If you find the ascended mummies

496
00:29:33,720 --> 00:29:34,620
using my information,

497
00:29:34,880 --> 00:29:36,140
you will have to pay me 10 times the amount.

498
00:29:36,640 --> 00:29:37,660
If you do not find the mummies,

499
00:29:39,030 --> 00:29:40,770
you can keep the checks.

500
00:29:42,440 --> 00:29:44,530
Miss Huo, you should leave.

501
00:29:52,830 --> 00:29:54,140
I'm new here.

502
00:29:54,550 --> 00:29:56,420
I do not know the rules in place.

503
00:29:57,790 --> 00:29:59,050
Forgive the insolence

504
00:29:59,830 --> 00:30:00,660
I displayed just now.

505
00:30:04,440 --> 00:30:05,140
Farewell.

506
00:30:07,030 --> 00:30:07,620
Wait.

507
00:30:11,580 --> 00:30:13,070
[Chief Auctioneer]

508
00:30:13,070 --> 00:30:15,290
Miss Huo, you came with such sincerity.

509
00:30:15,960 --> 00:30:18,770
We shouldn't disappoint you.

510
00:30:22,980 --> 00:30:25,420
[Two Weeks Later]

511
00:30:43,240 --> 00:30:44,700
You recovered so quickly.

512
00:30:45,440 --> 00:30:46,530
As expected of the Zhang Clan.

513
00:30:47,750 --> 00:30:48,090
Take this.

514
00:30:49,240 --> 00:30:49,570
Thanks.

515
00:30:50,510 --> 00:30:51,090
Well done.

516
00:30:52,310 --> 00:30:53,660
There, there.

517
00:30:57,030 --> 00:30:57,660
Master Zhang.

518
00:30:58,590 --> 00:31:00,050
It's been two weeks.

519
00:31:01,030 --> 00:31:02,010
This baby will be old enough

520
00:31:02,350 --> 00:31:04,180
to find a wife if we still don't find the Japanese.

521
00:31:07,350 --> 00:31:08,010
He's right.

522
00:31:08,680 --> 00:31:09,730
We know they are here,

523
00:31:09,960 --> 00:31:10,860
but we just can't find them.

524
00:31:11,830 --> 00:31:13,050
They don't start a fire during the day,

525
00:31:14,200 --> 00:31:15,220
and they don't put on lights either at night.

526
00:31:15,880 --> 00:31:16,700
How disciplined.

527
00:31:19,790 --> 00:31:20,660
If this carries on,

528
00:31:21,750 --> 00:31:22,810
we won't be able to find them.

529
00:31:24,160 --> 00:31:25,140
Then let's go down and find them.

530
00:31:25,920 --> 00:31:27,700
No. Our number is too small.

531
00:31:28,160 --> 00:31:29,380
If we assign one person to each mountain,

532
00:31:29,720 --> 00:31:31,420
it'll take at least three years to search this place.

533
00:31:33,480 --> 00:31:34,290
You know what, Master Zhang?

534
00:31:36,240 --> 00:31:37,530
Carry the baby for me.

535
00:31:42,160 --> 00:31:43,660
We'll lay a trap.

536
00:31:44,000 --> 00:31:44,860
We start a fire at night

537
00:31:45,310 --> 00:31:46,460
to invite them to ambush us.

538
00:31:48,830 --> 00:31:50,620
Hatoyama is a seasoned strategist.

539
00:31:51,030 --> 00:31:52,050
Do you think he'll fall for it?

540
00:31:54,160 --> 00:31:54,810
Right.

541
00:31:55,590 --> 00:31:56,620
What should we do now then?

542
00:31:57,270 --> 00:31:57,980
If this persists,

543
00:31:58,400 --> 00:31:59,940
Hatoyama's plan will come to fruition.

544
00:32:00,830 --> 00:32:01,860
Ask some to stay here.

545
00:32:02,310 --> 00:32:02,900
The rest will return to Changsha

546
00:32:03,920 --> 00:32:05,180
to dig the Otherworld Tower.

547
00:32:07,350 --> 00:32:08,530
We'll take the underground river?

548
00:32:10,590 --> 00:32:13,010
Despite Zhang Qishan's brilliant mind,

549
00:32:13,030 --> 00:32:16,010
the lead came to a dead end once again at Xiangxi.

550
00:32:16,270 --> 00:32:18,460
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama's slyness

551
00:32:18,510 --> 00:32:21,860
left the Mystic Nine stumped.

552
00:32:22,070 --> 00:32:24,460
Unbeknownst to them,

553
00:32:24,640 --> 00:32:26,700
another plan

554
00:32:26,830 --> 00:32:28,770
is carefully unfolding under Wu Laogou's

555
00:32:28,920 --> 00:32:30,380
machinations.

556
00:32:30,550 --> 00:32:32,200
Xiangxi has a lot of rivers.

557
00:32:32,480 --> 00:32:34,110
Upon receiving the information from Huo Xiangu,

558
00:32:34,240 --> 00:32:36,980
Lunar Hotel's informants in Xiangxi

559
00:32:37,070 --> 00:32:38,570
bought 82 Stockade

560
00:32:38,640 --> 00:32:40,220
to investigate every river.

561
00:32:40,510 --> 00:32:43,810
Eventually, they found their treasure

562
00:32:44,480 --> 00:32:47,980
on a small branch of the Xijiang River.

563
00:32:49,830 --> 00:32:50,380
Bring it up.

564
00:33:06,400 --> 00:33:06,860
Open it.

565
00:33:12,270 --> 00:33:12,900
An ascended mummy!

566
00:33:15,240 --> 00:33:15,860
Bring it back.

567
00:33:16,110 --> 00:33:16,570
Yes.

568
00:33:22,830 --> 00:33:23,330
Master.

569
00:33:26,200 --> 00:33:26,860
An urgent telegram from Beiping.

570
00:33:28,960 --> 00:33:30,940
I've been having nightmares.

571
00:33:31,350 --> 00:33:33,380
I keep dreaming about a capsizing boat. It scares me.

572
00:33:36,920 --> 00:33:39,250
I want the osmanthus pastry in Changsha.

573
00:33:39,590 --> 00:33:40,220
Buy some for me.

574
00:33:40,590 --> 00:33:41,090
Master Zhang,

575
00:33:41,550 --> 00:33:44,140
did something happen to your wife?

576
00:33:44,400 --> 00:33:45,220
She's fine.

577
00:33:45,640 --> 00:33:46,530
It's a secret code.

578
00:33:48,350 --> 00:33:49,420
What does it mean then?

579
00:33:52,480 --> 00:33:54,140
She must have missed you so much.

580
00:33:54,160 --> 00:33:56,050
She said that something huge had happened,

581
00:33:56,790 --> 00:33:57,980
and that there was no point in staying here.

582
00:33:58,720 --> 00:33:59,490
She told me to head back to Changsha

583
00:33:59,790 --> 00:34:00,860
as the lead would come to me instead.

584
00:34:02,680 --> 00:34:03,980
How did she find out about all this?

585
00:34:04,960 --> 00:34:06,490
She wouldn't have used this method to contact me

586
00:34:07,160 --> 00:34:08,650
unless there was a huge discovery.

587
00:34:09,710 --> 00:34:10,780
It might be related to Laogou.

588
00:34:11,920 --> 00:34:13,740
Perhaps she used the secret code because the Ministry of War

589
00:34:14,000 --> 00:34:14,980
was monitoring closely.

590
00:34:16,070 --> 00:34:17,650
Let's do as she says and return now.

591
00:34:18,070 --> 00:34:19,050
You don't say.

592
00:34:19,280 --> 00:34:19,940
Return to Changsha.

593
00:34:22,020 --> 00:34:24,480
[Lunar Hotel]

594
00:34:24,480 --> 00:34:26,260
Seal both chests tight.

595
00:34:26,480 --> 00:34:27,340
Do not let air in.

596
00:34:27,920 --> 00:34:29,780
Otherwise, the things inside will decay very quickly.

597
00:35:03,030 --> 00:35:03,980
Send me a telegram to tell me you're safe.

598
00:35:04,440 --> 00:35:05,050
Otherwise,

599
00:35:05,320 --> 00:35:06,210
I'll cheat on you.

600
00:35:09,190 --> 00:35:10,170
Lunar Hotel has become

601
00:35:10,230 --> 00:35:11,650
a place of strife and competition.

602
00:35:12,070 --> 00:35:14,460
Huo Xiangu holds the information. See her immediately.

603
00:35:15,110 --> 00:35:15,650
Xiaojin.

604
00:35:17,840 --> 00:35:19,780
Send a telegram. 8273. To Beiping.

605
00:35:29,190 --> 00:35:30,260
I am home safely.

606
00:35:31,960 --> 00:35:32,820
Do not miss me too much.

607
00:35:35,070 --> 00:35:36,740
Things are still convoluted and dangerous.

608
00:35:37,840 --> 00:35:40,380
I will let you know if there's any update.

609
00:35:41,630 --> 00:35:42,010
Yes.

610
00:35:44,920 --> 00:35:45,570
Is she here?

611
00:35:47,190 --> 00:35:47,690
Yes.

612
00:35:48,030 --> 00:35:49,820
She has been waiting for you in the back hall. She also said

613
00:35:50,230 --> 00:35:50,820
that you

614
00:35:51,230 --> 00:35:52,090
should see her when you arrive.

615
00:35:58,630 --> 00:35:59,690
Master Zhang, I'm surprised

616
00:35:59,880 --> 00:36:01,650
that you actually rushed back upon receiving the telegram.

617
00:36:02,480 --> 00:36:03,460
I trust

618
00:36:04,280 --> 00:36:05,420
you never joke around when it comes to Laogou.

619
00:36:05,920 --> 00:36:06,740
Did you find him?

620
00:36:07,920 --> 00:36:08,570
Too few leads.

621
00:36:09,550 --> 00:36:10,490
Same here.

622
00:36:13,150 --> 00:36:14,940
These are new items coming next month in Lunar Hotel's auction.

623
00:36:15,360 --> 00:36:16,940
In his message, Laogou mentioned

624
00:36:17,030 --> 00:36:17,980
these two chests.

625
00:36:18,800 --> 00:36:20,010
Did he say where he was

626
00:36:20,440 --> 00:36:21,090
and how to save him?

627
00:36:22,670 --> 00:36:23,210
No, he did not.

628
00:36:29,190 --> 00:36:30,610
Laogou said those two chests

629
00:36:30,630 --> 00:36:31,740
were the key to finding him.

630
00:36:32,230 --> 00:36:33,940
I made it so that the Lunar Hotel secured the chests.

631
00:36:34,440 --> 00:36:35,860
But I can't do much about the rest.

632
00:36:36,280 --> 00:36:37,740
Master Zhang, I hope you can do your best

633
00:36:37,880 --> 00:36:38,860
to win the bid for the chests.

634
00:36:39,590 --> 00:36:40,740
That way, the truth

635
00:36:41,670 --> 00:36:42,610
will surface.

636
00:36:45,590 --> 00:36:47,090
The Lunar Hotel is unique in the sense

637
00:36:47,320 --> 00:36:48,740
that it houses every precious item in the world.

638
00:36:49,590 --> 00:36:50,780
No one is guaranteed

639
00:36:51,230 --> 00:36:53,050
to get what they want in the auction.

640
00:36:53,510 --> 00:36:54,170
But you

641
00:36:54,920 --> 00:36:56,210
are the owner's son-in-law.

642
00:36:56,510 --> 00:36:58,340
I'm sure this won't be too difficult

643
00:36:59,510 --> 00:37:00,340
for you.

644
00:37:01,800 --> 00:37:02,610
I'm counting on you, Master Zhang.

645
00:37:09,840 --> 00:37:11,420
Given my relationship with Laogou,

646
00:37:12,070 --> 00:37:13,740
I should come with you.

647
00:37:14,360 --> 00:37:16,340
But my clan has undergone a lot of changes.

648
00:37:16,960 --> 00:37:18,530
I have a lot on my plate.

649
00:37:21,030 --> 00:37:22,420
So, I shall not burden you further.

650
00:37:23,000 --> 00:37:23,980
Do you need help?

651
00:37:31,320 --> 00:37:33,090
Xiangu, you went to Beiping without telling us.

652
00:37:33,590 --> 00:37:35,300
Why can't we maintain open communication with each other?

653
00:37:38,710 --> 00:37:40,490
We are familiar with the Lunar Hotel.

654
00:37:43,000 --> 00:37:45,210
Coincidentally, these antiques

655
00:37:45,480 --> 00:37:46,940
require appraisal from a professional

656
00:37:47,320 --> 00:37:48,380
before we can trust them.

657
00:37:48,550 --> 00:37:50,980
Therefore, I'd like to invite you

658
00:37:52,230 --> 00:37:54,090
to come to the auction with us.

659
00:37:57,110 --> 00:37:58,050
How come

660
00:37:58,590 --> 00:37:59,900
you're so interested in the places I've been?

661
00:38:00,230 --> 00:38:02,010
Your sudden visit to the Lunar Hotel

662
00:38:02,920 --> 00:38:04,490
might be closely connected

663
00:38:04,960 --> 00:38:05,940
to another incident

664
00:38:06,230 --> 00:38:07,650
we encountered.

665
00:38:07,800 --> 00:38:08,820
Spare me the details.

666
00:38:09,280 --> 00:38:10,300
I do not want to know everything.

667
00:38:11,670 --> 00:38:13,010
If it has nothing to do with you,

668
00:38:13,190 --> 00:38:15,340
what's stopping you from joining us?

669
00:38:15,760 --> 00:38:16,570
In Beiping,

670
00:38:17,480 --> 00:38:20,010
Lunar Hotel is not an ordinary auction hall.

671
00:38:20,800 --> 00:38:21,820
What's in it for me

672
00:38:22,880 --> 00:38:24,130
if I come with you?

673
00:38:24,880 --> 00:38:25,650
I promise you

674
00:38:26,960 --> 00:38:28,380
that your ailment

675
00:38:31,030 --> 00:38:32,610
will be cured.

676
00:38:34,880 --> 00:38:35,780
Find Laogou.

677
00:38:36,960 --> 00:38:37,940
I can handle

678
00:38:39,230 --> 00:38:40,130
the rest.

679
00:38:46,000 --> 00:38:46,530
Guards.

680
00:38:47,190 --> 00:38:48,090
Bring Eighth Master over.

681
00:38:50,060 --> 00:38:53,780
[Beiping City's Latest Map]

682
00:38:55,590 --> 00:38:56,090
Master Zhang,

683
00:38:57,110 --> 00:38:58,010
you've been studying it for a while.

684
00:38:58,510 --> 00:38:59,740
Take a break and eat something.

685
00:39:00,590 --> 00:39:01,740
You're so carefree, Eighth Master.

686
00:39:02,150 --> 00:39:02,940
You still have a good appetite.

687
00:39:03,760 --> 00:39:05,300
Fill your stomach first.

688
00:39:05,760 --> 00:39:07,260
There is still hope now.

689
00:39:07,670 --> 00:39:08,860
If we fall here, how are we supposed

690
00:39:09,400 --> 00:39:10,260
to save Laogou?

691
00:39:12,280 --> 00:39:13,650
Auction Item No. 038 and 039

692
00:39:14,150 --> 00:39:15,820
in the Lunar Hotel.

693
00:39:16,440 --> 00:39:17,300
They are

694
00:39:17,960 --> 00:39:19,650
two chests containing ascended mummies.

695
00:39:20,400 --> 00:39:21,380
Tiezui, check

696
00:39:22,230 --> 00:39:23,900
if they came from Xiangxi.

697
00:39:23,900 --> 00:39:25,380
[Artifact Chest]

698
00:39:27,550 --> 00:39:28,210
Yes, they are.

699
00:39:30,070 --> 00:39:31,380
Laogou wrote to Xiangu

700
00:39:32,110 --> 00:39:33,740
telling her that the artifact chests led to him.

701
00:39:34,070 --> 00:39:36,090
Therefore, we must win the bid for the chests.

702
00:39:38,030 --> 00:39:39,300
He wrote to Xiangu?

703
00:39:41,550 --> 00:39:42,170
Right.

704
00:39:43,000 --> 00:39:44,090
Both of them

705
00:39:44,670 --> 00:39:46,570
should share a way of communicating.

706
00:39:47,230 --> 00:39:48,260
Every rich man in this nation

707
00:39:49,110 --> 00:39:50,900
has now gathered in Beiping.

708
00:39:52,070 --> 00:39:53,010
On the eve of battle,

709
00:39:54,550 --> 00:39:56,490
they want to turn liquidity into antiques

710
00:39:57,030 --> 00:39:59,210
before transferring them abroad.

711
00:40:00,110 --> 00:40:01,210
They will achieve this at all costs.

712
00:40:01,960 --> 00:40:03,210
Even if we combine all our assets in the Mystic Nine,

713
00:40:03,840 --> 00:40:04,900
we probably will lose the bid.

714
00:40:06,590 --> 00:40:07,090
Master Zhang,

715
00:40:07,760 --> 00:40:09,650
aren't you the son-in-law of Lunar Hotel?

716
00:40:10,440 --> 00:40:12,690
Lunar Hotel was established 300 years ago.

717
00:40:13,480 --> 00:40:14,820
Their rules have never been broken before.

718
00:40:15,920 --> 00:40:17,820
A son-in-law is replaceable.

719
00:40:18,280 --> 00:40:20,530
Their reputation is the foundation of their success.

720
00:40:22,800 --> 00:40:25,380
Then, we need to prepare enough money.

721
00:40:28,840 --> 00:40:30,940
You still haven't paid me back for the blanket bid I made back then.

722
00:40:31,670 --> 00:40:33,900
Even if we were as rich as before,

723
00:40:34,070 --> 00:40:35,170
we still wouldn't win the bid.

724
00:40:36,960 --> 00:40:37,900
I see, Master Zhang.

725
00:40:38,320 --> 00:40:40,650
Let me buy some joss paper

726
00:40:41,000 --> 00:40:41,980
and burn it for Laogou.

727
00:40:42,630 --> 00:40:45,130
May he rest in peace.

728
00:40:45,840 --> 00:40:48,010
Today will be his death anniversary.

729
00:40:48,280 --> 00:40:49,170
What do you think?

730
00:40:50,510 --> 00:40:52,530
So, instead of bidding for it

731
00:40:53,670 --> 00:40:55,260
in the Lunar Hotel,

732
00:40:56,150 --> 00:40:57,260
we steal it.

733
00:40:57,360 --> 00:40:58,170
Steal it?

734
00:40:59,150 --> 00:41:01,010
The most expensive antiques are,

735
00:41:01,150 --> 00:41:01,980
without exception,

736
00:41:02,230 --> 00:41:04,090
auctioned in the Lunar Hotel.

737
00:41:05,510 --> 00:41:07,780
The influence of the Lunar Hotel runs deep.

738
00:41:08,710 --> 00:41:10,940
Their rules must be respected, whether you're a law-abiding citizen

739
00:41:11,230 --> 00:41:12,300
or a gangster.

740
00:41:13,150 --> 00:41:16,090
In this trip, other than the other buyers,

741
00:41:16,840 --> 00:41:19,170
we must guard against ear slaves

742
00:41:20,070 --> 00:41:20,860
and pole slaves.

743
00:41:24,230 --> 00:41:25,210
Ear slaves have good hearing.

744
00:41:26,000 --> 00:41:28,010
They can pick up any noise within a 100-meter radius.

745
00:41:28,760 --> 00:41:30,340
Anything that happens during the auction

746
00:41:30,670 --> 00:41:32,010
will not escape their ears.

747
00:41:33,070 --> 00:41:34,260
Pole slaves are masters of polearms.

748
00:41:34,880 --> 00:41:36,300
Their polearms contain poisonous needles.

749
00:41:36,710 --> 00:41:38,690
They can kill someone from a great distance.

750
00:41:39,550 --> 00:41:40,780
If a rabble-rouser runs into a pole slave

751
00:41:40,800 --> 00:41:41,570
in the Lunar Hotel,

752
00:41:41,960 --> 00:41:44,170
they will die within five steps.

753
00:41:45,480 --> 00:41:47,050
The latest auction in the Lunar Hotel

754
00:41:47,710 --> 00:41:48,940
has also turned underground.

755
00:41:49,590 --> 00:41:50,530
[Lunar Hotel]
There is a new rule.

756
00:41:51,070 --> 00:41:52,650
Before the hour of Xu, it's the morning session.

757
00:41:52,840 --> 00:41:54,300
After the hour of Xu, it's the evening session.

758
00:41:55,230 --> 00:41:57,010
You need to win the bid for three items in the morning session

759
00:41:57,480 --> 00:41:58,650
to join the evening session.

760
00:41:59,480 --> 00:42:01,050
During the auction,

761
00:42:01,510 --> 00:42:03,090
you can sit individually or in a private cabin.

762
00:42:03,710 --> 00:42:04,900
Those in the private cabin can make a blanket bid.

763
00:42:05,670 --> 00:42:07,170
Those two items that Laogou wants us to bid

764
00:42:07,880 --> 00:42:09,740
will surely appear in the evening session.

765
00:42:11,440 --> 00:42:12,610
Thus, our mission is

766
00:42:13,710 --> 00:42:14,300
firstly,

767
00:42:14,760 --> 00:42:15,650
win the bid

768
00:42:16,320 --> 00:42:17,490
of three items in the morning session

769
00:42:17,510 --> 00:42:18,260
to enter the evening session.

770
00:42:18,880 --> 00:42:19,380
Secondly,

771
00:42:20,000 --> 00:42:20,860
we will secure a private cabin

772
00:42:21,880 --> 00:42:22,820
in the evening session.

773
00:42:23,740 --> 00:42:25,260
[Beiping City's Latest Map]

774
00:42:29,370 --> 00:42:31,270
How can we secure a private cabin, then?

775
00:42:32,230 --> 00:42:34,460
There are so many rich people in Beiping now.

776
00:42:34,920 --> 00:42:36,570
Even if we pool the wealth of the Mystic Nine,

777
00:42:36,920 --> 00:42:37,570
we will probably

778
00:42:37,590 --> 00:42:39,010
be given individual seats.

779
00:42:39,440 --> 00:42:40,860
That's embarrassing, Master Zhang.

780
00:42:42,920 --> 00:42:44,260
It's easy to secure a private cabin.

781
00:42:44,920 --> 00:42:45,820
You just need money.

782
00:42:46,510 --> 00:42:47,460
With enough money,

783
00:42:48,070 --> 00:42:48,940
you can enter a private cabin.

784
00:42:50,760 --> 00:42:51,380
I see.

785
00:42:52,070 --> 00:42:54,650
You want us to raise funds

786
00:42:55,000 --> 00:42:56,130
for you to sit alone in the cabin.

787
00:42:56,510 --> 00:42:57,300
The rest will sit on individual seats.

788
00:42:57,510 --> 00:42:57,980
No.

789
00:42:58,760 --> 00:43:00,300
One private cabin can accommodate two people.

790
00:43:01,030 --> 00:43:02,650
We need two private cabins at least.

791
00:43:03,000 --> 00:43:05,420
One to hype the scene

792
00:43:05,670 --> 00:43:06,780
and draw the attention of the ear slaves.

793
00:43:07,030 --> 00:43:08,050
The other cabin to...

794
00:43:08,150 --> 00:43:08,690
To steal

795
00:43:09,000 --> 00:43:09,690
the chests

796
00:43:10,190 --> 00:43:10,940
and kidnap your father-in-law.

797
00:43:11,590 --> 00:43:13,240
Do whatever we can to get the chests

798
00:43:13,280 --> 00:43:15,210
and restore your bachelor status.

799
00:43:24,630 --> 00:43:26,170
Who is the richest in the Mystic Nine?

800
00:43:27,280 --> 00:43:28,380
Xie Jiu.

801
00:43:30,360 --> 00:43:31,460
Isn't the case he's dealing with now

802
00:43:31,710 --> 00:43:33,050
the consequences of what he did

803
00:43:33,190 --> 00:43:34,570
when he helped you in the Lunar Hotel?

804
00:43:36,880 --> 00:43:39,050
And he shall solve it where it began.

805
00:43:40,000 --> 00:43:40,780
Gather our accounts

806
00:43:41,320 --> 00:43:42,130
and bring

807
00:43:42,550 --> 00:43:43,650
all of your money.

808
00:43:44,480 --> 00:43:45,740
Master Zhang, I have no money.

809
00:43:46,480 --> 00:43:48,010
I was already penniless last time.

810
00:43:51,280 --> 00:43:52,340
Xiangu won't join us

811
00:43:52,960 --> 00:43:54,130
in Beiping.

812
00:43:55,110 --> 00:43:56,650
Just the three of us won't make the cut.

813
00:43:57,630 --> 00:43:58,380
We need

814
00:43:59,280 --> 00:44:00,820
two more people on top of Xie Jiu.

815
00:44:01,230 --> 00:44:02,090
Two more people?

816
00:44:03,110 --> 00:44:04,820
I'll handle Xie Jiu.

817
00:44:05,510 --> 00:44:06,530
Find the rest yourself.

818
00:44:08,150 --> 00:44:08,490
Master Zhang.

819
00:44:09,550 --> 00:44:10,740
This will be challenging.

820
00:44:11,360 --> 00:44:12,740
While the meeting we had last time

821
00:44:12,760 --> 00:44:14,380
seems to suggest that there is unity among us,

822
00:44:14,550 --> 00:44:16,010
but we all know

823
00:44:16,230 --> 00:44:17,460
that we each have a mess to clean up.

824
00:44:18,110 --> 00:44:19,740
Our subordinates have long-standing feuds,

825
00:44:20,150 --> 00:44:22,050
and now you want him to help you?

826
00:44:23,030 --> 00:44:24,170
That's a tall order.

827
00:44:29,230 --> 00:44:30,170
I believe the Mystic Nine

828
00:44:31,590 --> 00:44:32,780
knows what the right thing to do is.

829
00:44:51,260 --> 00:44:55,420
♪The past fades like smoke♪

830
00:44:55,780 --> 00:44:58,500
♪A choice is made in silence♪

831
00:44:58,780 --> 00:45:01,580
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

832
00:45:01,980 --> 00:45:05,740
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

833
00:45:05,980 --> 00:45:09,420
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

834
00:45:09,700 --> 00:45:13,100
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

835
00:45:13,180 --> 00:45:20,460
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

836
00:45:20,900 --> 00:45:24,180
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

837
00:45:24,460 --> 00:45:27,700
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

838
00:45:27,860 --> 00:45:31,900
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

839
00:45:32,100 --> 00:45:35,460
♪Who believes in fate?♪

840
00:45:35,700 --> 00:45:39,060
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

841
00:45:39,300 --> 00:45:42,580
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

842
00:45:42,900 --> 00:45:46,580
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

843
00:45:46,780 --> 00:45:50,020
♪Take care♪

844
00:45:50,020 --> 00:45:52,580
♪We once raced♪

845
00:45:52,660 --> 00:45:54,580
♪For the dawn♪

846
00:45:54,740 --> 00:45:58,020
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

847
00:45:58,140 --> 00:46:01,420
♪In the web of fate♪

848
00:46:01,420 --> 00:46:04,620
♪No one can escape♪

849
00:46:05,620 --> 00:46:07,460
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

850
00:46:07,620 --> 00:46:09,180
♪We too were young once♪

851
00:46:09,260 --> 00:46:12,700
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

852
00:46:12,900 --> 00:46:15,220
♪Keep the ember lit♪

853
00:46:15,340 --> 00:46:19,860
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

854
00:46:19,980 --> 00:46:22,940
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

855
00:46:23,180 --> 00:46:26,700
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

856
00:46:26,820 --> 00:46:30,580
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

857
00:46:30,900 --> 00:46:34,380
♪Who believes in fate?♪

858
00:46:34,540 --> 00:46:37,540
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

859
00:46:37,780 --> 00:46:41,540
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

860
00:46:41,700 --> 00:46:45,420
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

861
00:46:45,540 --> 00:46:56,980
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
